    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia kūlagīja mihayo ya pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hezekia ūtūma nhūng'wa ū kū Baisilaeli a bose; na a banhū ba Efulaimu na Manase ūbandīkīla nyalūba ja kūbeegeleja kwiza ī Yelusalemu ū kūhekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, kwiza kwīlya ī pasaka kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi na a batūmami bakwe, na a banhū a bose abo baalī bibilinga mu Yelusalemu būbona gīkī īkūbeelela kwīlya ī pasaka mu ng'weji gwa kabīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalemeelwa ū kwīlya ū ng'wikanza īlo līhelilwe kūlwa nguno baalī batī bingī a bagabīji abo baalī biyeeja, na a banhū baalī bataalī ū kwibilinga ū mu Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūūbeelela ū kūlī ntemi na a banhū pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbona batūme mhola hose pyī ū mu Isilaeli, kwandīja Beeli-sheba kūshisha Dani, babalaalīke a banhū bize ī Yelusalemu kwīlya ī pasaka kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli. Nguno yalī yabīta myaka mingī ītūyegelagwa na banhū bingī gīt'ūmo yalī yandīkīlilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi ūlagīja banhū būja hose pyī ū mu Isilaeli nī Yuda, būja babūūkije nyalūba kūfuma ū kūlī ntemi nū kū batūmami bakwe; jihayile, “Banhū ba Isilaeli, nshokelagi SEEBA, ū Mulungu o ng'wa Abulahamu, Isaka na Isilaeli; nang'hwe amushokele a bing'we abo ng'wasaagīīlile, abo ng'wapūlūgūkile mu nkono gwa batemi ba Baashulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizūbiza gīt'ūmo baalī a babyaji bing'we na a baana ba ng'wing'we, abo baalī batī bigwi ū kūlī SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo; kūshisha nose ūbīīta kūbiza shikolo sha kūkamaaja gīt'ūmo mulībonela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizūbiza na mitwe midimu gīt'ūmo baalī a babyaji bing'we, idoohyagi ū kūlī SEEBA; nzūgi ū kwipandī ī lyeela īlo walyeeja shikū ja welelo bose. Ntūmamīlagi ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wing'we, ū būpelanu wakwe būng'wīngīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūnshokela ū SEEBA bakūchīlwa shigongo a baana ba ng'wing'we, na a baana bing'we. Abo babadima nding'wa bakūbalekela bashoke hangī ū mu sī īyī; nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alī wa shigongo, na akabasaatagwa a banhū bakwe. Ūlū ng'ūngalūkīla atūng'winhīla ngongo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baalī baatūng'wa būja mu būlī nzengo ū mu sī ya Efulaimu nī Manase, būūkashika nī Zabuloni. Alīyo a banhū babasekaga na kūbineenelegeja dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a heene banhū balebe ba Asheli, Manase na Zabuloni bakidoohya biza ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī nīyo ū mu Yuda ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gwalī hamò nabo a banhū, kūlwa kūbinha būmò wa maganiko gīkī bīīshikīlīje īyo walī wīlagīla ū ntemi na a batūmami bakwe; gīt'ūmo gūhayīlile mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikanza lya kūyegela pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū mu ng'weji gwa kabīlī libilinga ibità itaale lya banhū ū mu Yelusalemu, kūlwa kūshiyegela ī shigukulu sha migatī ītī na shibimbya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīyīnja ī myalīlo ū mu Yelusalemu, nī myalīlo ya kūzuukīlīgīja būbbani bīyīnja yūūkaponyiwa kū longa lwa Kiduloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'holo ja pasaka būjisīnza ha lūshikū lw'ikūmi na'inè, ū ng'weji gwa kabīlī gwenūyo. A bagabīji na a Balawī bakading'wa minala biyeeja, bandya kūshenha ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho būlī bene būjidima ī ndīīma jabo, gīt'ūmo shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa munhū o ng'wa Mulungu sholekegije. A bagabīji būgaseseebela a mininga ayo bakayinhīlījiwa na Balawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īkī banhū bingī ū ng'wibità baalī batiyeegije, a Balawī īkabigeleelwa kūbasīnzīla ī pasaka jabo pye a banhū abo baalī bateelile, abo baalī batadūgije ū kūjifunya ī ng'holo jabo ja pasaka ū kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo baalī batiyeegije baalī bingī; ī no no no a ba kūfuma Efulaimu, Manase, Isakaali na Zabuloni. Alīyo nahene bakīīlya ī pasaka, a kahelele ako katūūlilwe katakūūbīlījiwe. Gwike ū Hezekia akabalombela alīhaya, “Ū SEEBA ūyo alī wawiza anchīle shigongo būlī ng'wene ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo ng'holò yakwe īlolelile mu kū nkooba Mulungu, ū SEEBA ūyo alī Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bakwe, nūūlū ūbiza ī haha atiyeegije gīt'ūmo kalī kajīle ka ng'wipandī lyeela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū SEEBA ūng'wigwa ū Hezekia, ūbapīja a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Isilaeli abo baalīho ī Yelusalemu, būmala shikū mpungatī bakūshilyaga mu būyegi būtaale ī shigukulu sha migatī ītī na shibimbya. A Balawī na a bagabīji bīmbaga būlī lūshikū ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, kūnū nī shikolo sha kwīmbīla shikūtūlagwa kūlwa kūnkumīlīja ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ūlūngalūnga na a Balawī a bose mihayo ya kūbatimbya ng'holò, nguno boolechaga gīkī bagūmanile ū nīmo gwa kūnamya ū SEEBA. A banhū būjimala ī shikū mpungatī ja shigukulu shenīsho bakūlyaga shilīwa īsho baalī bahelelilwe, kūnū bakūfunyaga shakwinha sha būsangī na kūnkumīlīja ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū a bose abo baalī bibilinga bizunīlīja kongeja hangī shikū jingī mpungatī ja kūyegela hamò. Na lūūlū būmala shikū jingī mpungatī bakūlyaga na būyegi būtaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia ū ntemi wa Yuda ūfunya nzagamba shihūmbī shimò, na ng'holo hamò na mbūli shihūmbī mpungatī, kūlwa kūlya a banhū. A batūmami nabo būfunya nzagamba shihūmbī shimò, na shihūmbī ikūmi sha ng'holo na mbūli; bagabīji bingī bongeja kwiyeeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libità ī lyose ī lya Yuda lyūyega no, hamò na a bagabīji na a Balawī; na a bose abo baalī biza kūfuma Isilaeli, pye na a balobeji; a ba kūfuma Isilaeli na a ba mu Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
